        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "(And the Lord gave Israel a saviour, so that they went out from under the hand of the Syrians: and the children of Israel dwelt in their tents, as beforetime.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 28,
            "end": 35,
